        "original_id": "e88ec981-fd18-5c5c-bdda-4526298a83c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jason Connery, Peter Mullan, Jack Lowden\n- Works: Tommy's Honour, War & Peace\n- Roles: director, actor\n- Topics: film and stage careers\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Andrew Lowden was born on 2 June 1990 and is a Scottish stage, television, and film actor.\n- Jack Lowden had a highly successful and award-winning four-year stage career before his first major international onscreen success.\n- In 2016, Jack Lowden's first major international onscreen success came in the BBC miniseries \"War & Peace\", which led to starring roles in feature films.\n- The film \"Tommy's Honour\" is directed by Jason Connery.\n- In \"Tommy's Honour\", the father and son are portrayed by Peter Mullan and Jack Lowden.",
